# OpenTofu / Terraform.
# State is the sensitive one: harness_platform_secret_text stores the secret
# VALUE in plaintext in state, so the GitHub App private key lives there in
# base64. Never commit it, and treat the state file like the .pem itself.
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/*.tfvars
!terraform/*.tfvars.example
crash.log

# Never the key material itself, wherever it lands.
*.pem
*.key

# NOTE: charts/*/charts/*.tgz and Chart.lock are committed ON PURPOSE - the
# gitops-helm dependency is vendored so nothing is fetched from the internet
# at deploy time, which is the usual reason Native Helm fails on a
# locked-down cluster.
